ressor that squeezes the gas back into a liquid."},{"role":"name","text":"This is a refrigerator."},{"role":"how","text":"Squeezing makes the gas hot, so coils underneath shed that heat."},{"role":"fact","text":"It holds your food at 4 degrees Celsius."},{"role":"myth","text":"And the cold is not blown in."},{"role":"mythFact","text":"A fridge only moves heat out to the coils outside."},{"role":"finish","text":"Add a glass door, shelves and a light."},{"role":"congrats","text":"Congratulations, you have built a fridge."}]}